Z||000000||Gokart||09-27-1999||07:39 PM||||I'm getting ready to purchase a window to replace my badly scratched drivers side one. Does it matter if mine is a GT and I buy one from a coupe? Does it matter if I have power windows and the coupe does not? TIA! ||||reg||5
