Z||000006||batboy||09-28-1999||11:19 PM||||Recently, I got in an argument with a Pontiac parts guy about Fiero door parts. I was getting a door handle and inner linkage clip. He asked what year and I told him it didn't matter. He got mad and told me it did matter because some years were different. I finally told him 85 to shut him up. When he found it in the book, it said "door assembly, all Fieros 84-88" and of course I pointed that out to him. You could tell he was fuming.||||reg||1
